# Hunt #1 — SSH Brute Force Behavioral Pattern
# Groups SSH-related alert events by source IP within a 2-minute
# window to detect brute-force-shaped bursts, independent of any
# specific signature ID firing. See Day 8 docs.

sourcetype=json-2 event_type=alert dest_ip=10.10.20.10 dest_port=22
| transaction src_ip maxspan=2m
| where eventcount > 4